### Variables
@baseUrl = http://localhost:3400
@contentType = application/json

### ─── Health & DB ──────────────────────────────────────

### Health Check
GET {{baseUrl}}/health

### DB Ping
GET {{baseUrl}}/db/ping

### ─── Kundali: Generate (JSON) ─────────────────────────

### Generate Kundali — Mumbai birth
POST {{baseUrl}}/kundali/generate
Content-Type: {{contentType}}

{
  "coordinates": "19.0760,72.8777",
  "datetime": "1990-01-01T10:30:00+05:30",
  "ayanamsa": 1,
  "la": "en",
  "label": "Sahil Kashetwar"
}

### Generate Kundali — Delhi birth (Hindi)
POST {{baseUrl}}/kundali/generate
Content-Type: {{contentType}}

{
  "coordinates": "28.6139,77.2090",
  "datetime": "1985-01-01T14:15:00+05:30",
  "ayanamsa": 1,
  "la": "hi",
  "label": "Sahil"
}

### Generate Kundali — Bangalore (Raman ayanamsa)
POST {{baseUrl}}/kundali/generate
Content-Type: {{contentType}}

{
  "coordinates": "12.9716,77.5946",
  "datetime": "2000-01-01T00:00:00+05:30",
  "ayanamsa": 3,
  "la": "en",
  "label": "Millennial"
}

