### ─── Error cases ──────────────────────────────────────

### Missing coordinates (should 400)
POST {{baseUrl}}/kundali/generate
Content-Type: {{contentType}}

{
  "datetime": "1990-01-01T10:30:00+05:30"
}

### Invalid datetime format (should 400)
POST {{baseUrl}}/kundali/generate
Content-Type: {{contentType}}

{
  "coordinates": "19.0760,72.8777",
  "datetime": "not-a-date"
}

### Empty body (should 400)
POST {{baseUrl}}/kundali/generate
Content-Type: {{contentType}}

{}
